<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head><meta charset="UTF-8"><title>Study Permit Retainer Agreement</title></head>
<body>
<h1>Study Permit Retainer Agreement</h1>
<p><strong>Date:</strong> {{date}}</p>

<h2>Parties</h2>
<p>This retainer agreement is entered into between the immigration consulting firm
(<strong>Firm ID:</strong> {{firmId}}) and the client:</p>
<p><strong>Client Name:</strong> {{applicantName}}<br>
<strong>Client Email:</strong> {{applicantEmail}}</p>

<h2>Scope of Services</h2>
<p>The firm agrees to provide the following services in connection with the client's
Study Permit application:</p>
<ul>
  <li>Assessment of eligibility for a Canadian Study Permit</li>
  <li>Preparation and review of application forms (IMM 1294)</li>
  <li>Document checklist and verification</li>
  <li>Submission to Immigration, Refugees and Citizenship Canada (IRCC)</li>
  <li>Post-submission follow-up and status updates</li>
</ul>

<p><strong>Institution:</strong> {{institution}}</p>
<p><strong>Program:</strong> {{program}}</p>
<p><strong>Estimated Start Date:</strong> {{startDate}}</p>

<h2>Fees</h2>
<p><strong>Professional Fee:</strong> {{professionalFee}} CAD</p>
<p><strong>Government Processing Fee:</strong> {{governmentFee}} CAD (paid directly to IRCC)</p>
<p>Fees are held in the firm's client trust account until earned.</p>

<h2>Terms</h2>
<ol>
  <li>The firm will exercise professional judgement and comply with IRCC requirements.</li>
  <li>No refund of professional fees once work has commenced.</li>
  <li>Government fees are non-refundable once submitted to IRCC.</li>
  <li>This agreement is governed by the laws of Canada.</li>
</ol>

<h2>Signature</h2>
<p>By signing below, the client agrees to the terms of this retainer agreement.</p>
<div class="signature-area">
  <p>Client Signature: ______________________________</p>
  <p>Date: ______________________________</p>
</div>
</body>
</html>
